00:00:00:12 , 00:00:03:00 , Morning on the Saltmere breakwater.
00:00:03:05 , 00:00:05:20 , The ferry leaves at seven,|as it has for forty years.
00:00:06:00 , 00:00:08:00 , ^I[gulls calling]^I
00:00:08:05 , 00:00:11:00 , Tide's turning. We should check|the mooring buoys.
00:00:11:05 , 00:00:14:00 , The lighthouse keeper logs|every boat that passes.
00:00:14:05 , 00:00:16:12 , ^I♪ brass band playing ♪^I
00:00:16:20 , 00:00:19:13 , Harbour office, this is the pilot launch.
00:00:19:17 , 00:00:22:00 , Fog rolls in from the outer mole by noon.
00:00:22:05 , 00:00:25:00 , Keep to the marked channel|past the red buoy.
00:00:25:05 , 00:00:28:00 , By evening the quay is quiet again.
